  55   42    jump +17                (to 59)
       43    load_var 12             (_13)
       44    store_var_load_var 13   (u)

  56   45    load_field 2            (role)
       46    discriminant            
       47    jump_table 0            ([to 57, to 54, to 51, to 48], default to 115)

  60   48    load_var 2              (threshold)
